{"unit_id": "tag:04MH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的有限局部自由（finite locally free）态射（morphism）。存在不交并分解（disjoint union decomposition）<MATH_0002>，其各项均为开（open）且闭的子概形（closed subschemes），使得令<MATH_0003>后，限制映射（restrictions）<MATH_0004>都是有限局部自由（finite locally free）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0005>，次数（degree）为<MATH_0006>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union decomposition", "target_term": "不交并分解"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭的子概形"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "原态射的源与靶。"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "原态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形间箭头。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union decomposition", "target_term": "不交并分解", "context": "将概形分成两两不交的各项。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "分解各子概形的开性。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭的子概形", "context": "分解各项的闭子概形结构。"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "原态射在分解各项上的限制。"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "各限制态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "限制所得的各概形间箭头。"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "各有限局部自由态射的次数。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04MH:proof", "translation": "这是因为有限局部自由（finite locally free）层（sheaf）局部具有良定义的秩（rank）。细节略去。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "所用的层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "局部具有秩的对象。"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩", "context": "该层局部具有的良定义数值。"}], "notes": []}
