{"unit_id": "tag:03HW:proof", "translation": "写成<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>。另见《代数（Algebra）补充》第<REF_0001>节。\n设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的生成元（generators）。对每个<MATH_0006>，可选取首一多项式（monic polynomial）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>中成立。应用《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>（共<MATH_0010>次），得到一个有限局部自由（finite locally free）的环（ring）扩张（extension）<MATH_0011>，使每个<MATH_0012>都完全分裂（splits completely）为<MATH_0013>，其中<MATH_0014>为某些相应的元素。\n令<MATH_0015>及<MATH_0016>。映射（map）<MATH_0017>，<MATH_0018>是一个<MATH_0019>-代数（algebra）满射（surjection）。令<MATH_0020>、<MATH_0021>及<MATH_0022>，可见第（1）至第（4）项成立。第（5）项成立，因为在集合（set）意义下，<MATH_0023>是由理想（ideals）<MATH_0024>截出的闭子概形（closed subschemes）的并（union），其中<MATH_0025>任取。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "generators", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "monic polynomial", "target_term": "首一多项式"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "splits completely", "target_term": "完全分裂"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "补充章节题名中的学科名。"}, {"source_term": "generators", "target_term": "生成元", "context": "所给代数在基环上的生成元。"}, {"source_term": "monic polynomial", "target_term": "首一多项式", "context": "对每个生成元选取的多项式。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在章的题名。"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "所得环扩张的性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "构成该扩张的代数