{"unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。注意，若<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>都是<MATH_0004>中的稠密开集（dense open），则<MATH_0005>也是如此。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本段给定的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "两个给定集合的共同性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RS:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphisms），分别定义在稠密（dense）开子集（open subsets）<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>上，所相对的概形是<MATH_0007>。我们称<MATH_0008><TEXTITOPEN_0001>等价（equivalent）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>于<MATH_0009>，如果<MATH_0010>对某个<MATH_0011>成立，其中后者是<MATH_0012>中的稠密开集（dense open）。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>从<MATH_0013>到<MATH_0014>的有理映射（rational map）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是第（1）项所定义的等价关系（equivalence relation）的一个等价类（equivalence class）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016>是基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0017>上的概形（schemes），则称从<MATH_0018>到<MATH_0019>的有理映射（rational map）为<TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0020>-有理映射（rational map）（从<MATH_0021>到<MATH_0022>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果该等价类（equivalence class）存在一个代表元（representative）<MATH_0023>，且它是<MATH_0024>-态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射"}, {"source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系"}, {"source_term": "equivalence class", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射"}, {"source_term": "equivalence class", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义开头给定的两个对象。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "限定用于定义等价性的态射所属的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "各自在稠密开子集上定义的两个箭头。"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密", "context": "两个定义域在指定概形中的性质。"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "两个态射各自的定义域。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "第（1）项所定义的两态射之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "见证两个态射等价所用的开集。"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射", "context": "第（2）项以等价类定义的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系", "context": "由第（1）项给出的关系。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence class", "target_term": "等价类", "context": "在该关系下构成一个有理映射的类。"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形", "context": "第（3）项中两个概形共同的基。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定为基概形上的两个对象。"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射", "context": "第（3）项中接受进一步限定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "rational map", "target_term": "有理映射", "context": "带有基概形限定的有理映射。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence class", "target_term": "等价类", "context": "从其中选取代表元的类。"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表元", "context": "须符合基上态射条件的等价类成员。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "相应代表元所须具有的箭头类型。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对于定义第（1）项中的两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>，我们以“它们定义同一个有理（rational）映射（map）”的说法代替“它们等价（equivalent）”的说法。在某些情形下，有理（rational）映射（maps）由泛点（generic points）处局部环（local rings）上的映射（maps）确定。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "rational", "target_term": "有理"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "rational", "target_term": "有理"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义第（1）项中的两个箭头。"}, {"source_term": "rational", "target_term": "有理", "context": "限定两个态射所确定的共同映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "两个等价态射所确定的同一个对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "定义第（1）项所规定的关系。"}, {"source_term": "rational", "target_term": "有理", "context": "限定由局部环上数据确定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "某些情形下由局部环上数据确定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "取局部环的点。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "由泛点取出的局部代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于确定有理映射的局部环上的映射。"}], "notes": []}
